<title>UK: Crave Trust sets $475 mln three-year bond.</title>
<headline>Crave Trust sets $475 mln three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager JP Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CRAVE TRUST</p>
<p> AMT    $475 MLN	COUPON     6.68	MATURITY    12.AUG.00</p>
<p> TYPE   EURO 144A     ISS PRICE  99.989    PAY DATE  S-19.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   REOFFER    99.989    SPREAD	+65 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	A2	  LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOV BOND  6.0 PCT JULY 2002 UST</p>
<p> NOTES	SECURED WITH $500 MILLION OF UST BONDS WHICH MAY BE</p>
<p>		SUBSTITUTED AT ANY TIME WITH $500 MILLION OBLIGATIONS</p>
<p>		ISSUED OR FULLY GUARANTEED BY BAT INDUSTRIES PLC.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
